{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Enforce the limit on the final candidate**\n\nAfter operations and payloads are removed, this returns without rechecking size. A large execution error or identity field can therefore remain above the exporter's limit and be rejected downstream. Remeasure the final rendering, bound remaining optional fields such as error text, and skip/log when no legal record fits; test oversized errors in both render shapes.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sv5Et","finding_digest":"9516049f6847938afa61ef85f5a32cabcc5c4d5b3363450a60ed42321de98275","finding_id":"arf_v1_sulajh3ii6jyv6tb56c7lizmvp","finding_key":"insight-plugin/truncation.java::truncaterecord::final-size-bound","identity_key":"insight-plugin/truncation.java::truncaterecord::final-size-bound","line":89,"observation_digest":"9d8dd35538b951265c22f22d649d3ac3106b6f78c7dc14b13eca864c58fb899d","observation_id":"aro_v1_twg5gvjyxfismxbc6iwwjhj2ym","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/Truncation.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_sulajh3ii6jyv6tb56c7lizmvp","published_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:14Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gaza4v2hy7owxqmfaj7d3xtx4q","reviewed_base_sha":"686c447b61d148228285e1d3e9c07d0b3b0358b1","reviewed_head_sha":"661ff218518770f142c359f81bc08e3d93bc5a7d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":89,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_y5lslxtb7c4knd5gg2tbfwiqyn","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:14Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
